* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.shaderpack binary
# Files `rexglue codegen` rewrites at every build, always with LF line endings:
# checked out with LF too, so that they do not show as modified (and `git pull`
# does not refuse to update them) on Windows, where `text=auto` would give them CRLF.
mcla_manifest.toml text eol=lf
generated/rexglue.cmake text eol=lf
